# eOn SVN r2549. HarnessCounter through ext_pot. Kernel lammps.
# Plain NEB. Same settings as eon-svn/de-lj38-ci with climbing_image_method false. r2549 has no energy-weighted springs and no ci_mmf. The run swaps the potential for ext_pot. The harness kernel is the develop kernel for this potential name. The 2014 table used r2156. The binary is SVN r2549, the registry pin. Export of the 2014 revision is forbidden, so this row is r2549.
# Each start is the mean of 2 replicates (svn-all and fortran). n is the number of distinct starts. 0 starts differ in force_calls. Success agrees on every start.
counter harness
code Eon svn
code_version r2549
commit r2549
algorithm LBFGS
tuning default
template eon-svn/de-lj38-neb
problem double-ended-saddle-search/lj38
reducer harness
cap 2500
n 50
par2_mean 1571.34
nfailed 9
mean_calls 1121.34
median_calls 774.5
min_calls 357.0
max_calls 2500.0
n_crash 0
n_divergence 0
n_cap 9
n_wrong_stationary 0
n_replicates 2
n_differing 0
